# S01: the cold open's first shot, e1m1's first corridor as 1996 drew it. Classic at
# 320x200, shown 4:3, no status bar, id's Brightness slider at 0.7. A linear dolly down
# the corridor; the film uses seconds 1 to 7 (a second of handle each end). No sound: in
# the game's own mixer this corridor is silent.

map e1m1

duration 8
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera path
key 0  480,-367.33,110  0,90  ease linear
key 8  480,-244.67,110  0,90

sound off
events on
